-That bothers me a bit. -Why do you always...

1335
00:58:33,340 --> 00:58:36,810
[Hyeyeon: It's not over yet. Why are you
always thinking about the future?]

1336
00:58:36,810 --> 00:58:45,090
[Sujin: That said, even if you didn't vote
for me, I'll still vote for you.]

1337
00:58:45,090 --> 00:58:48,290
[Hyeyeon: What? Are you going to
keep threatening me with this?]

1338
00:58:48,240 --> 00:58:50,150
-No, it's not a threat. -Voting.

1339
00:58:48,290 --> 00:58:52,290
[Sujin: No, it's not a threat. You don't
actually think it is, do you?]

1340
00:58:52,290 --> 00:58:56,560
[Sujin: It really isn't. Don't think that way.
Hyeyeon: OK.]

1341
00:58:56,560 --> 00:58:59,500
[Hyeyeon: I see you're applying for chats
everywhere.]

1342
00:58:59,500 --> 00:59:00,570
[Me? Yes!]

1343
00:59:00,570 --> 00:59:01,640
[Of course]

1344
00:59:05,110 --> 00:59:09,110
[Sujin: I just asked,
and Seungho's first choice is you.]

1345
00:59:09,110 --> 00:59:10,980
[Sujin: You know you're his first choice too.]

1346
00:59:10,980 --> 00:59:12,050
[Hyeyeon: I know.]

1347
00:59:12,050 --> 00:59:17,650
[Hyeyeon: But I don't know if he likes me more
or if his feelings for Jinwoo have faded.]

1348
00:59:17,650 --> 00:59:21,120
[Sujin: Regardless of his feelings for Jinwoo...]

1349
00:59:21,120 --> 00:59:25,660
[Sujin: When we played the King Game,
he chose you when he was picked.]

1350
00:59:25,660 --> 00:59:29,400
[Hyeyeon: You made Jinwoo and Seungho kiss
during the game.]

1351
00:59:29,400 --> 00:59:31,800
[Sujin: Did I do that? I'm sorry.]

1352
00:59:31,800 --> 00:59:34,200
[Hyeyeon: I have to talk to Seungho today too.]

1353
00:59:34,200 --> 00:59:36,070
[Sujin: Go ahead.
Hyeyeon: We already made an appointment.]

1354
00:59:36,070 --> 00:59:41,410
[Sujin: Because I think today is an important day.
Hyeyeon: Did he look tired?]

1355
00:59:41,410 --> 00:59:43,540
[Sujin: Today is an important day, because I...]

1356
00:59:43,540 --> 00:59:46,750
[Sujin: I said from the beginning
that I wanted to get close to you.]

1357
00:59:46,450 --> 00:59:46,760
Right.

1358
00:59:46,750 --> 00:59:49,420
[Sujin: Even if you don't end up with me,]

1359
00:59:49,420 --> 00:59:53,420
[Sujin: I hope things work out well for you
with someone else.]

1360
00:59:53,420 --> 00:59:59,020
[Sujin: You're already thinking beyond
the final couple to a real-life couple, right?]

1361
00:59:59,020 --> 01:00:01,950
[Sujin: Didn't you think that far?
I thought you would.]

1362
01:00:01,950 --> 01:00:06,760
[Hyeyeon: Are you from the production team, Sujin?
Of course I can't tell you everything.]

1363
01:00:06,760 --> 01:00:11,030
[Hyeyeon: Go find your own love.
Don't worry so much about others.]

1364
01:00:11,030 --> 01:00:15,030
[Sujin: You're right. I'm being too nosy.
I'm sorry.]

1365
01:00:15,030 --> 01:00:16,370
[Hyeyeon: You don't have to apologize to me.]

1366
01:00:16,370 --> 01:00:19,570
[Sujin: Why? You might be feeling upset.]

1367
01:00:19,570 --> 01:00:20,910
[Hyeyeon: But I wonder if you told]

1368
01:00:20,910 --> 01:00:23,040
[Hyeyeon: Jinwoo or anyone else]

1369
01:00:23,040 --> 01:00:25,310
[Hyeyeon: that you were my second choice.]

1370
01:00:25,310 --> 01:00:27,580
[Hyeyeon: I had that thought.]

1371
01:00:28,650 --> 01:00:31,850
[Sujin: I didn't tell Jinwoo.
Hyeyeon: No, I mean anyone.]

1372
01:00:31,850 --> 01:00:34,250
[Sujin: I really didn't say anything.]

1373
01:00:34,250 --> 01:00:36,650
[Got it. Good job.]

1374
01:00:36,650 --> 01:00:39,060
[Sujin: I just predicted it with Eunchae,
but I really didn't say anything.]

1375
01:00:39,060 --> 01:00:42,790
[Sujin: So I really hope
you don't misunderstand that.]

1376
01:00:42,790 --> 01:00:47,070
[Hyeyeon: I'll tidy up a bit and come down.]

1377
01:00:52,400 --> 01:00:55,610
[Sujin: I had some alone time with Jinwoo.]

1378
01:00:55,610 --> 01:00:59,880
[Sujin: From Hyeyeon's perspective, did I say]

1379
01:00:59,880 --> 01:01:02,810
[Sujin: something about her to Jinwoo]

1380
01:01:02,810 --> 01:01:04,780
[Sujin: and cause a misunderstanding?]

1381
01:01:04,780 --> 01:01:08,250
[Sujin: "I'm texting you in case you misunderstood.
I didn't choose you yesterday just because you were nearby, or out of guilt.
Although I jokingly brushed it off by saying my intuition is bad,
I was a bit shocked because I didn't know how you felt at all.
In that moment, so many emotions welled up inside me.
I haven't done that, so if you misunderstood..."]

1382
01:01:08,250 --> 01:01:10,390
[Sujin: "Because my feelings are always so complicated and changing,
I think some things I said casually might have upset you.
I was inconsiderate, and I want to apologize.
Also, during my date with Jinwoo today,
I somehow felt competitive, thinking you liked Heejin.
Other than that, we only talked about Jinwoo.
I never said that I was your second choice.
I'm sorry if I made you unhappy."]

1383
01:01:10,390 --> 01:01:12,140
[Sujin: "Then we talked about who your second choice might be.
Jinwoo said he thought it was either me or Eunchae.
I said it was probably Eunchae since we hadn't interacted much.
Then we immediately changed the subject.
I'm really sorry if you felt upset from your perspective."
I sent this apologetic SBM Talk.]

1384
01:01:12,140 --> 01:01:13,900
[Sujin: "And regarding things you didn't need to tell me,
I asked some questions out of curiosity that I should've been careful about.
You didn't have to tell me everything.
I shouldn't have said those things. I'm sorry."
I sent this apologetic SBM Talk.]

1385
01:01:18,130 --> 01:01:21,070
[Hyeyeon: Come over here a bit.
Should we hide here?]

1386
01:01:21,070 --> 01:01:22,400
[Hyeyeon: You're sleepy, right?]

1387
01:01:22,400 --> 01:01:23,470
[Seungho: Not yet.]

1388
01:01:26,940 --> 01:01:28,810
[Hyeyeon: Why did you choose me?]

1389
01:01:28,810 --> 01:01:32,010
[Seungho: Should I tell the truth? Or...]

1390
01:01:32,010 --> 01:01:34,410
[Hyeyeon: Tell the truth.
Do you want me to guess?]

1391
01:01:34,410 --> 01:01:37,080
[Hyeyeon: If I was at this level
and Jinwoo was at this level,]

1392
01:01:37,080 --> 01:01:39,860
[Hyeyeon: did Jinwoo go down and I go up?]

1393
01:01:39,860 --> 01:01:41,860
[Yeah, that's right.
Sujin: You might need to take the phone upstairs.]

1394
01:01:41,860 --> 01:01:43,220
[Hyeyeon: Oh.
Jinwoo: I'll take it up for her.]

1395
01:01:43,220 --> 01:01:45,360
[Seungho: Me too. The phone...]

1396
01:01:45,360 --> 01:01:46,580
[Seungho: With Jinwoo,]

1397
01:01:46,580 --> 01:01:49,250
[Seungho: something happened
that had a pretty big impact.]

1398
01:01:49,250 --> 01:01:51,120
[Hyeyeon: With Jinwoo?
Seungho: When you weren't here...]

1399
01:01:51,120 --> 01:01:52,720
[Hyeyeon: Is it... the phone call
mentioned earlier?]

1400
01:01:52,720 --> 01:01:54,320
[Seungho: Not that.]

1401
01:01:54,320 --> 01:01:56,190
[Seungho: That's included too.]

1402
01:01:56,190 --> 01:01:59,390
[Glance
Seungho: A lot of...]

1403
01:02:02,860 --> 01:02:04,470
[Seungho: They can see us.
Hyeyeon: Oh, really?]

1404
01:02:04,470 --> 01:02:07,670
[Seungho: Isn't this even weirder?
What's up?]

1405
01:02:11,670 --> 01:02:13,810
[Jinwoo: Ah, are you talking?]

1406
01:02:17,010 --> 01:02:19,950
[Jinwoo brought Hyeyeon's phone up.]

1407
01:02:19,950 --> 01:02:22,620
[Hyeyeon: Should we go down?
There seems to be no one on the first floor.]

1408
01:02:22,620 --> 01:02:24,750
[Seungho: OK.]

1409
01:02:28,340 --> 01:02:30,460
[Jinwoo: The chance to reconcile is gradually...]

1410
01:02:30,460 --> 01:02:32,230
[Jinwoo: Feeling like it's being pushed back.]

1411
01:02:32,230 --> 01:02:33,290
[Jinwoo: This makes me regret it a bit.]

1412
01:02:33,290 --> 01:02:35,430
[Jinwoo: If I had tried to talk first,]

1413
01:02:35,430 --> 01:02:38,100
[Jinwoo: it wouldn't have come to this
and be so awkward now.]

1414
01:02:38,100 --> 01:02:40,230
[Jinwoo: It's still so awkward even now.]

1415
01:02:43,170 --> 01:02:45,310
[Hyeyeon: That means there is something.]

1416
01:02:45,310 --> 01:02:49,580
[Hyeyeon: Anyway, it's not
that he likes me more.]

1417
01:02:49,580 --> 01:02:52,510
[Hyeyeon: And his feelings for Jinwoo]

1418
01:02:52,510 --> 01:02:54,920
[Hyeyeon: might just be temporary.
Just because his feelings faded,

1419
01:02:54,920 --> 01:02:56,250
[Hyeyeon: he chose me today.]

1420
01:02:56,250 --> 01:02:58,920
[Seungho: You can see it that way.]

1421
01:02:58,920 --> 01:03:01,860
[Hyeyeon: Then I might
get pushed back down again.]

1422
01:03:01,860 --> 01:03:03,730
[Seungho: I can't say for sure.]

1423
01:03:03,730 --> 01:03:06,930
[Seungho: But I don't think this problem
will be easily solved.]

1424
01:03:06,930 --> 01:03:08,800
[Hyeyeon: Really?]

1425
01:03:08,800 --> 01:03:12,270
[Seungho: Today with Jinwoo...]

1426
01:03:12,270 --> 01:03:15,740
[Seungho: it seemed like we didn't say a word.
Hyeyeon: Really?]

1427
01:03:12,340 --> 01:03:13,200
Say it.

1428
01:03:15,740 --> 01:03:18,140
[Seungho: Just the most basic exchanges.]

1429
01:03:18,140 --> 01:03:20,810
[Seungho: We didn't say a word in private.]

1430
01:03:20,810 --> 01:03:23,210
[Hyeyeon: Then that's a good thing for me.]

1431
01:03:23,480 --> 01:03:26,410
[Hyeyeon: Oh, awesome!
Isn't this my chance? So...]

1432
01:03:26,410 --> 01:03:28,820
[Hyeyeon: Even though I'm happy,
Seungho is very sad.]

1433
01:03:28,820 --> 01:03:32,290
[Hyeyeon: But because I also want to
compete fairly...]

1434
01:03:32,290 --> 01:03:35,220
[Hyeyeon: "Why is he like that? It's too mean."
I didn't reply like this.

1435
01:03:35,490 --> 01:03:39,490
[Hyeyeon: Things that make you happy,
and things that make you unhappy now,

1436
01:03:39,490 --> 01:03:41,630
[Hyeyeon: and the little things
that keep piling up,

1437
01:03:41,630 --> 01:03:46,430
[Hyeyeon: or maybe your demands on Jinwoo,]

1438
01:03:46,430 --> 01:03:50,970
[Hyeyeon: are all because you have feelings
for him. That's what I think.]

1439
01:03:50,970 --> 01:03:54,180
[Seungho: That might also be right.]

1440
01:03:54,180 --> 01:03:56,580
[Seungho: Besides these,
what happened yesterday...]

1441
01:03:56,580 --> 01:03:58,450
[Is that so?
Seungho: makes me feel like it's not the case.]

1442
01:03:58,450 --> 01:04:04,590
[Seungho: At first, my heart was wavering a lot.]

1443
01:04:04,590 --> 01:04:06,450
[Seungho: Not because of someone,]

1444
01:04:06,450 --> 01:04:08,860
[Seungho: but my own heart was wavering.]

1445
01:04:08,860 --> 01:04:12,590
[Seungho: So no matter what,
I won't approach him first.]

1446
01:04:12,590 --> 01:04:16,600
[Hyeyeon: Then what? Are you going to sleep
in Yongkyu's room?

1447
01:04:20,330 --> 01:04:22,740
[Seungho: I'm not close with Eunchae. No.]

1448
01:04:22,740 --> 01:04:25,670
[Hyeyeon: Then Sujin? Do you want to
sleep in Sujin's room?]

1449
01:04:25,670 --> 01:04:27,280
[Hyeyeon: Come to my bed.]

1450
01:04:29,140 --> 01:04:31,550
[Hyeyeon: Draw a line directly.]

1451
01:04:35,550 --> 01:04:39,820
[Hyeyeon: Feel like it won't be easily solved?
Seungho: It does feel that way.]

1452
01:04:39,820 --> 01:04:43,830
[Hyeyeon: But what about the call...
You went after you picked up the call.]

1453
01:04:43,830 --> 01:04:47,560
[Seungho: Yeah, it's some things
that happened after that.]

1454
01:04:47,560 --> 01:04:49,960
[Hyeyeon: Then you were right to go.]

1455
01:04:51,030 --> 01:04:53,970
[Seungho: It was a situation where I was angrier.]

1456
01:04:53,970 --> 01:04:56,900
[Seungho: But he said he was in a bad mood first.]

1457
01:04:56,900 --> 01:04:58,770
[Seungho: I really don't like this point.]

1458
01:04:58,770 --> 01:05:00,110
[Hyeyeon: Because I don't know what it is.]

1459
01:05:00,110 --> 01:05:03,850
[Hyeyeon: What exactly made you so angry?]

1460
01:05:03,850 --> 01:05:07,320
[Seungho: The things he said, and his actions.
Those two things...]

1461
01:05:07,320 --> 01:05:11,850
[Seungho: And he said he felt like
he couldn't keep his promise.]

1462
01:05:11,850 --> 01:05:15,060
[Seungho: Anyway, I came to BI-LIVE in the end.]

1463
01:05:15,060 --> 01:05:19,060
[Seungho: When he made that call,
he was disappointed because I said that.]

1464
01:05:17,950 --> 01:05:19,020
And this.

1465
01:05:19,060 --> 01:05:23,060
[Seungho: It felt like talking behind someone's
back, even though it wasn't about me.]

1466
01:05:23,060 --> 01:05:26,530
[Seungho: With that feeling,
suddenly all the words...]

1467
01:05:26,530 --> 01:05:29,470
[Hyeyeon: It's obvious.
Seungho: And to someone I'm not close with...]

1468
01:05:29,470 --> 01:05:31,610
[Hyeyeon: Also said it to others too.
Seungho: To Eunchae.]

1469
01:05:31,610 --> 01:05:35,080
[Seungho: Said everything.]

1470
01:05:35,080 --> 01:05:36,940
[Hyeyeon: Why is he like that?]

1471
01:05:36,940 --> 01:05:39,350
[Hyeyeon: Do you want me to go fight him for you?]

1472
01:05:40,950 --> 01:05:44,690
[Hyeyeon: If I fight him, can I take the spot
next to you?]

1473
01:05:44,690 --> 01:05:48,690
[Hyeyeon: Jinwoo probably still likes you.]

1474
01:05:48,690 --> 01:05:49,760
[Hyeyeon: Just like I do.]

1475
01:05:49,760 --> 01:05:54,830
[Seungho: Yeah, but I don't know. Either way...]

1476
01:05:54,830 --> 01:05:58,570
[Seungho: It's not the same feeling
as the beginning.]

1477
01:05:58,570 --> 01:06:00,700
[Hyeyeon: I wouldn't do that.]

1478
01:06:00,700 --> 01:06:02,570
[Hyeyeon: I don't smoke either.]

1479
01:06:02,570 --> 01:06:07,380
[Hyeyeon: And I wouldn't be tender
and affectionate to others.]

1480
01:06:07,380 --> 01:06:11,380
[Nodding
Hyeyeon: I've never made you sad, you know?]

1481
01:06:11,380 --> 01:06:13,250
[Hyeyeon: You look really sad.]

1482
01:06:13,250 --> 01:06:18,050
[Seungho: It's just... Talking about it
all the time is exhausting.]

1483
01:06:18,050 --> 01:06:22,320
[Seungho: It's frustrating. We have to talk
at least once, anyway.]

1484
01:06:22,320 --> 01:06:26,060
[Hyeyeon: Will you try to talk to him?]

1485
01:06:26,060 --> 01:06:28,730
[Seungho: I don't know if I'll try.]

1486
01:06:28,730 --> 01:06:31,930
[Seungho: If I face that situation,
I probably won't refuse.]

1487
01:06:31,930 --> 01:06:34,600
[Hyeyeon: Don't solve it.

1488
01:06:34,600 --> 01:06:36,740
[Seungho: If he doesn't approach...]

1489
01:06:36,740 --> 01:06:39,410
[Hyeyeon: He definitely will.
[Seungho: Because I won't take the initiative.]

1490
01:06:39,410 --> 01:06:41,810
[Seungho: He didn't come near me
once today either.]

1491
01:06:41,810 --> 01:06:43,950
[Hyeyeon: Maybe he's reading the room?]

1492
01:06:43,950 --> 01:06:46,080
[Seungho: That could be it too.]

1493
01:06:46,080 --> 01:06:48,480
[Hyeyeon: I took care of you a lot today.]

1494
01:06:48,480 --> 01:06:50,890
[Hyeyeon: I feel like you've been treating me
as your second choice.]

1495
01:06:50,890 --> 01:06:52,890
[Yeah]

1496
01:06:52,890 --> 01:06:54,890
[Hyeyeon: You're talking to me
like I'm your second choice.]

1497
01:06:54,890 --> 01:06:56,760
[Hyeyeon: Although it can't be helped,]

1498
01:06:56,760 --> 01:06:58,360
[Hyeyeon: it feels like there is
definitely a difference.]

1499
01:06:58,360 --> 01:07:00,230
[Hyeyeon: Although I know your feelings
for Jinwoo]

1500
01:07:00,230 --> 01:07:02,360
[Hyeyeon: are naturally stronger...]

1501
01:07:02,360 --> 01:07:04,770
[Hyeyeon: Although he smokes,
he'll quit if you become the final couple.]

1502
01:07:04,770 --> 01:07:06,630
[Hyeyeon: You were moved by those words.]

1503
01:07:06,630 --> 01:07:08,500
[Hyeyeon: It's a chance I can't have.]

1504
01:07:08,500 --> 01:07:10,100
[Hyeyeon: Because I don't smoke.]

1505
01:07:10,100 --> 01:07:12,510
[Seungho: It's exactly because of this.]

1506
01:07:12,510 --> 01:07:14,910
[Seungho: Anyway, for a promise he made,]

1507
01:07:14,910 --> 01:07:17,580
[Seungho: he lied directly and broke it.]

1508
01:07:17,580 --> 01:07:20,250
[Seungho: "Would it be like that?" I asked,
and then]

1509
01:07:20,250 --> 01:07:21,850
[Seungho: he just brushed it off. Then suddenly,]

1510
01:07:21,850 --> 01:07:24,250
[Seungho: after something like this happened,]

1511
01:07:24,250 --> 01:07:25,850
[Seungho: he said something like that.]

1512
01:07:25,850 --> 01:07:28,790
[Seungho: He said that in a bad situation.]

1513
01:07:28,790 --> 01:07:31,460
[Seungho: Because of other things,
plus hearing that,]

1514
01:07:31,460 --> 01:07:32,530
[Seungho: it turned out like this.]

1515
01:07:32,530 --> 01:07:34,660
[Seungho: What is he trying to do?]

1516
01:07:34,660 --> 01:07:36,000
[Hyeyeon: But if you try to talk

1517
01:07:36,000 --> 01:07:38,400
[Hyeyeon: and he says he'll quit smoking,]

1518
01:07:38,400 --> 01:07:42,400
[Hyeyeon: the chances of you changing your mind...
[Seungho: I don't think he'll say that.]

1519
01:07:42,400 --> 01:07:43,740
[Hyeyeon: That's not necessarily true.]

1520
01:07:43,740 --> 01:07:46,140
[Seungho: I don't think he will.
Hyeyeon: Really?]

1521
01:07:46,140 --> 01:07:48,540
[Seungho: If he was going to,
he should have said it then, honestly.]

1522
01:07:49,340 --> 01:07:51,480
[Seungho: I don't know why he acted like that
at the time,]

1523
01:07:51,480 --> 01:07:53,880
[Seungho: but with the feelings he had then,
now...]

1524
01:07:53,880 --> 01:07:57,890
[Seungho: Either I don't like him as much anymore,
or]

1525
01:07:57,890 --> 01:07:59,490
[Seungho: it might even just end like this.]

1526
01:07:59,490 --> 01:08:03,490
[Seungho: It feels like there's no reason
to give my heart anymore. That's how it sounds.]

1527
01:08:03,490 --> 01:08:06,960
[Seungho: Anyway, I just don't really like it.]

1528
01:08:06,960 --> 01:08:11,230
[Hyeyeon: Then, Seungho, you were the King
in the King Game, right?]

1529
01:08:11,230 --> 01:08:12,830
[Hyeyeon: So you could have easily
paired others up,]

1530
01:08:12,830 --> 01:08:16,300
[Hyeyeon: instead of yourself.]

1531
01:08:16,300 --> 01:08:17,910
[Hyeyeon: But you chose me,]

1532
01:08:17,910 --> 01:08:20,840
[Hyeyeon: and told me to say 10 seconds
of honest feelings to you.]

1533
01:08:20,840 --> 01:08:27,250
[Hyeyeon: Was it because your relationship
with Jinwoo broke down]

1534
01:08:27,250 --> 01:08:29,380
[Hyeyeon: that you wanted to hear
my true feelings?]

1535
01:08:29,380 --> 01:08:33,390
[Seungho: Anyway, things weren't good back then.]

1536
01:08:33,390 --> 01:08:35,790
[Seungho: And I couldn't have chosen Jinwoo.]

1537
01:08:35,790 --> 01:08:38,189
[Seungho: The person I wanted to choose...
Hyeyeon: I mean, there were so many...]

1538
01:08:38,189 --> 01:08:40,859
[Hyeyeon: Everyone thought they'd]

1539
01:08:40,859 --> 01:08:43,529
[Hyeyeon: always be mutual.]

1540
01:08:43,529 --> 01:08:46,729
[Hyeyeon: There really was a lot of skinship
in the King Game, wasn't there?]

1541
01:08:46,729 --> 01:08:49,939
[Seungho: Didn't I tell you
Jinwoo talked to Eunchae?]

1542
01:08:49,939 --> 01:08:52,870
[Seungho: So Eunchae also tried her best]

1543
01:08:52,870 --> 01:08:56,080
[Hyeyeon: to match you up again.
Seungho: Assigning cheek kisses and stuff.]

1544
01:08:56,080 --> 01:08:57,950
[Hyeyeon: But it was still exciting, right?]

1545
01:08:57,950 --> 01:09:01,950
[Seungho: It was exciting, but it felt like
I was backing off a lot.]

1546
01:09:01,950 --> 01:09:05,420
[Seungho: Compared to back then,
it feels different.]

1547
01:09:05,420 --> 01:09:07,560
[Hyeyeon: That's good.]

1548
01:09:07,560 --> 01:09:11,029
[Hyeyeon: Even though it hurts a bit
to see you sad, Seungho,]

1549
01:09:11,029 --> 01:09:14,500
[Hyeyeon: it's not bad for me.]

1550
01:09:14,500 --> 01:09:16,359
[Hyeyeon: For me, it's definitely an opportunity.]

1551
01:09:16,359 --> 01:09:19,029
[Hyeyeon: I'm confident I won't let you
end up like that.]

1552
01:09:19,029 --> 01:09:23,040
[Seungho: I just want to ask him]

1553
01:09:23,040 --> 01:09:28,109
[Seungho: what it all meant. It feels like
a lot of things were just brushed off.]

1554
01:09:26,160 --> 01:09:27,850
-Are there a lot?
-Quite a few.

1555
01:09:28,109 --> 01:09:31,850
[Hyeyeon: Don't ask.]

1556
01:09:31,850 --> 01:09:34,779
[Hyeyeon: Don't be too sad.]

1557
01:09:34,779 --> 01:09:37,180
[Hyeyeon: And don't worry about it.]

1558
01:09:37,180 --> 01:09:39,050
[Hyeyeon: It will be very stressful.]

1559
01:09:39,050 --> 01:09:41,189
[Seungho: Yeah.]

1560
01:09:41,720 --> 01:09:44,660
[Seungho who has been frustrated all day]

1561
01:09:44,930 --> 01:09:48,660
[While Hyeyeon went to wash up...]

1562
01:09:49,180 --> 01:09:53,819
[Awkward]

1563
01:09:58,010 --> 01:10:01,740
[Jinwoo: Is it awkward? Being with me?
Seungho: No.]

1564
01:10:01,740 --> 01:10:04,140
[Jinwoo: Really?
Seungho: What's wrong?]

1565
01:10:04,140 --> 01:10:08,420
[Jinwoo: Because our last conversation
wasn't great.]

1566
01:10:08,420 --> 01:10:10,020
[Seungho: Yeah.]

1567
01:10:10,020 --> 01:10:13,490
[Jinwoo: But back then, I didn't mean]

1568
01:10:13,490 --> 01:10:18,290
[Jinwoo: to sound so harsh to you.]

1569
01:10:18,290 --> 01:10:20,690
[Jinwoo: First of all, I think I was
too emotional.]

1570
01:10:20,690 --> 01:10:24,170
[Jinwoo: I didn't feel anything at the time,
but looking back,]

1571
01:10:24,170 --> 01:10:26,570
[Jinwoo: I feel really sorry towards you.]

1572
01:10:26,570 --> 01:10:28,860
[Jinwoo: I still feel sorry now.]

1573
01:10:28,860 --> 01:10:30,570
[No.
Jinwoo: I still feel sorry now.]

1574
01:10:30,570 --> 01:10:38,310
[Jinwoo: I thought that
if I spoke my true feelings,]

1575
01:10:38,310 --> 01:10:40,180
[Jinwoo: the conversation would go smoothly.]

1576
01:10:40,180 --> 01:10:43,120
[Jinwoo: Anyway, that was just my own thought.]

1577
01:10:44,990 --> 01:10:47,660
[Seungho: It's definitely better
to tell the truth.]

1578
01:10:47,660 --> 01:10:50,590
[Jinwoo: Yes. So...]

1579
01:10:50,590 --> 01:10:53,790
[Jinwoo: I've been worried since the conversation
ended like that.]

1580
01:10:54,060 --> 01:10:55,660
[Jinwoo: So I'm sure]

1581
01:10:55,660 --> 01:10:58,330
[Jinwoo: it's hard to treat you like before.]

1582
01:10:58,330 --> 01:11:01,540
[Jinwoo: It wasn't my intention]

1583
01:11:01,540 --> 01:11:07,140
[Jinwoo: to say those emotional words to you.]

1584
01:11:07,140 --> 01:11:10,080
[Jinwoo: So I'm sorry.]

1585
01:11:10,080 --> 01:11:14,080
[Seungho: You don't have to be too sorry.]

1586
01:11:14,080 --> 01:11:17,820
[Jinwoo: I think you must be feeling bad too.]

1587
01:11:17,820 --> 01:11:20,220
[Seungho: Yes.
Jinwoo: So I feel sorry.]

1588
01:11:20,220 --> 01:11:22,620
[Jinwoo: I often forget about the age difference.]

1589
01:11:22,620 --> 01:11:25,030
[Jinwoo: And because we live here,]

1590
01:11:25,030 --> 01:11:28,500
[Jinwoo: I kind of forgot
that you are still young.]

1591
01:11:28,500 --> 01:11:31,170
[Jinwoo: So I acted like that.]

1592
01:11:31,170 --> 01:11:34,100
[Jinwoo: This hurts me a lot.]

1593
01:11:34,100 --> 01:11:39,170
[Jinwoo: If it disappointed you and hurt you,]

1594
01:11:39,170 --> 01:11:42,640
[Jinwoo: my previous care and sincerity
towards you...]

1595
01:11:42,640 --> 01:11:45,580
[Jinwoo: It feels like it's turned to nothing.]

1596
01:11:45,580 --> 01:11:47,180
[Jinwoo: I'm a little afraid of this.]

1597
01:11:47,180 --> 01:11:50,120
[Jinwoo: I feel anxious.
Carrying all of this alone...]

1598
01:11:50,120 --> 01:11:52,790
[Jinwoo: It's too much.]

1599
01:11:52,790 --> 01:11:55,720
[Jinwoo: It's such a huge emotional toll.]

1600
01:11:55,720 --> 01:11:58,930
[Jinwoo: So I poured my heart out to Heejin,
whom I trust and rely on,]

1601
01:11:58,930 --> 01:12:02,400
[Jinwoo: and to Eunchae.]

1602
01:12:02,400 --> 01:12:06,400
[Jinwoo: I wanted their advice, but I think]

1603
01:12:06,400 --> 01:12:09,340
[Jinwoo: you have every reason to be unhappy
about that situation.]

1604
01:12:09,340 --> 01:12:12,010
[Jinwoo: So I also...]

1605
01:12:12,010 --> 01:12:15,210
[Jinwoo: think I was wrong. After all,
it's between the two of us.]

1606
01:12:15,210 --> 01:12:17,880
[Jinwoo: I feel sorry to you about this.]

1607
01:12:17,880 --> 01:12:20,810
[Jinwoo: I want to apologize to you. I'm sorry.]

1608
01:12:20,810 --> 01:12:22,950
[Seungho: It's OK.]

1609
01:12:22,950 --> 01:12:25,620
[Jinwoo: After all, it's not
the final choice yet.]

1610
01:12:25,620 --> 01:12:28,820
[Jinwoo: So it's not certain.
But I think we can definitely]

1611
01:12:28,820 --> 01:12:32,560
[Jinwoo: solve the realistic problems
slowly outside the show.]

1612
01:12:32,560 --> 01:12:35,500
[Seungho: I don't think so.
Jinwoo: Which part?]

1613
01:12:35,500 --> 01:12:38,170
[Seungho: About solving it after the show.]

1614
01:12:38,170 --> 01:12:40,570
[Seungho: We have to become a final couple first.]

1615
01:12:40,570 --> 01:12:44,040
[Seungho: So I think it's unreasonable.]

1616
01:12:44,040 --> 01:12:46,440
[Jinwoo: Yes, I know that too.]

1617
01:12:46,440 --> 01:12:49,380
[Seungho: I don't know.]

1618
01:12:49,380 --> 01:12:50,980
[Seungho: First of all,]

1619
01:12:50,980 --> 01:12:57,920
[Seungho: I think I need to carefully analyze
what we said to know.]

1620
01:12:57,920 --> 01:12:59,790
[Jinwoo: Yeah.]

1621
01:12:59,790 --> 01:13:03,260
[Jinwoo: After all, your feelings
are the most important to me.]

1622
01:13:03,260 --> 01:13:06,460
[Jinwoo: And it's the same for Hyeyeon.]

1623
01:13:06,460 --> 01:13:10,730
[Jinwoo: Anyone who truly cares about you
would be like this.]

1624
01:13:10,730 --> 01:13:15,000
[Seungho: I feel like you're not sincere.]

1625
01:13:15,000 --> 01:13:19,010
[Jinwoo: Me? Which part gave you that feeling?]

1626
01:13:19,010 --> 01:13:21,940
[Seungho: What we talked about at that time.]

1627
01:13:21,940 --> 01:13:24,080
[Jinwoo: Not just what we talked about
sitting on the bench.]

1628
01:13:24,080 --> 01:13:27,820
[Seungho: The bench? That day.]

1629
01:13:27,820 --> 01:13:30,480
[Jinwoo: Everything we talked about that day?
Seungho: Overall.]

1630
01:13:30,480 --> 01:13:32,350
[Jinwoo: Overall?]

1631
01:13:32,350 --> 01:13:35,290
[Seungho: It made me feel like
you don't really like me.]

1632
01:13:35,290 --> 01:13:37,160
[Jinwoo: Is that what you think?]

1633
01:13:37,160 --> 01:13:39,830
[Jinwoo: Because I said I was wavering,]

1634
01:13:39,830 --> 01:13:42,760
[Jinwoo: you thought I lost interest?]

1635
01:13:42,760 --> 01:13:48,900
[Seungho: Including that, and other parts too.]

1636
01:13:48,900 --> 01:13:53,170
[Jinwoo: But I think we need to talk
to understand each other.]

1637
01:13:53,170 --> 01:13:57,180
[Jinwoo: You can say what you want to say now.]

1638
01:13:57,180 --> 01:13:59,580
[Jinwoo: If you don't want to...]

1639
01:13:59,580 --> 01:14:01,720
[Jinwoo: I think there's no other way.]

1640
01:14:01,720 --> 01:14:05,190
[Jinwoo: I'll just have to accept it.]

1641
01:14:05,190 --> 01:14:06,520
[Seungho: Yeah.]

1642
01:14:07,590 --> 01:14:09,990
[Jinwoo: I don't regret sitting on that bench]

1643
01:14:09,990 --> 01:14:13,730
[Jinwoo: to clear things up with you.]

1644
01:14:13,730 --> 01:14:15,860
[Jinwoo: I think it was very necessary for me]

1645
01:14:15,860 --> 01:14:17,200
[Jinwoo: in that situation.]

1646
01:14:17,200 --> 01:14:20,130
[Jinwoo: I would have done it no matter what.]

1647
01:14:20,130 --> 01:14:21,470
[Jinwoo: If there's anything I regret,]

1648
01:14:21,470 --> 01:14:24,670
[Jinwoo: it's only that my sincerity was slightly
misunderstood.]

1649
01:14:24,670 --> 01:14:28,140
[Jinwoo: I could have expressed it more gently,]

1650
01:14:28,140 --> 01:14:30,010
[Jinwoo: but I was a bit sharp
when expressing it.]

1651
01:14:30,010 --> 01:14:31,350
[Jinwoo: That's the only thing I regret.]

1652
01:14:31,350 --> 01:14:32,950
[Jinwoo: I don't regret the situation itself.]

1653
01:14:33,480 --> 01:14:36,950
[Can the tangled feelings
between Jinwoo and Seungho be resolved?]

1654
01:14:38,820 --> 01:14:41,490
[The sun rises on the sixth day]

1655
01:14:43,180 --> 01:14:47,090
[Morning arrives at BI-LIVE as well]

1656
01:14:52,340 --> 01:14:57,500
[Heejin, the first to wake up]

1657
01:15:01,300 --> 01:15:03,910
[Heejin: I planned to go for a morning run,]

1658
01:15:03,910 --> 01:15:05,780
[Heejin: so I even brought my sportswear.]

1659
01:15:05,780 --> 01:15:07,920
[Heejin: And I told Eunchae, "When you woke up,]

1660
01:15:07,920 --> 01:15:09,250
[Heejin: don't be startled
if I'm not next to you."]

1661
01:15:09,250 --> 01:15:12,060
[Heejin: I said that before I went to sleep.]

1662
01:15:12,380 --> 01:15:15,180
[Staring]

1663
01:15:26,600 --> 01:15:30,070
[Eunchae is still fast asleep]

1664
01:15:32,020 --> 01:15:34,860
[Tossing]

1665
01:15:41,420 --> 01:15:46,350
[Eunchae: When I opened my eyes,
Heejin wasn't there anymore.]

1666
01:15:47,690 --> 01:15:52,490
[Eunchae: But she probably knew I'd worry,
so she told me in advance.]

1667
01:15:52,490 --> 01:15:57,030
[Eunchae: So I didn't worry or feel anxious.]

1668
01:15:59,430 --> 01:16:03,970
[Eunchae returning to the still quiet
3-person room]

1669
01:16:10,220 --> 01:16:13,060
[Getting up]

1670
01:16:15,720 --> 01:16:17,850
[Yongkyu: The first and second day,]

1671
01:16:17,850 --> 01:16:20,250
[Yongkyu: I felt time was passing too slowly.
What should I do?]

1672
01:16:20,250 --> 01:16:23,720
[Yongkyu: My biggest thought was,
"What should I do first?"]

1673
01:16:24,260 --> 01:16:26,660
[Yongkyu: From the third and fourth day onwards,]

1674
01:16:26,660 --> 01:16:27,730
[Yongkyu: I felt I needed to pull myself together
quickly.]

1675
01:16:27,730 --> 01:16:30,660
[Yongkyu: I have to do something.]

1676
01:16:30,660 --> 01:16:34,130
[Yongkyu: I feel like time is flying.]

1677
01:16:35,860 --> 01:16:39,020
[Hyeyeon, Heejin, Seungho, Jinwoo]

1678
01:16:40,540 --> 01:16:41,610
[Heejin: Morning.]

1679
01:16:41,610 --> 01:16:43,480
[Jinwoo: Morning.]

1680
01:16:43,480 --> 01:16:45,610
[Heejin: Slept well last night, right?]

1681
01:16:45,610 --> 01:16:47,480
[Jinwoo: Slept really well.]

1682
01:16:50,300 --> 01:16:52,420
[Startled]

1683
01:17:00,290 --> 01:17:02,430
[Hyeyeon: I slept in.]

1684
01:17:07,620 --> 01:17:09,020
[What? Hahaha]

1685
01:17:09,100 --> 01:17:11,770
[Jinwoo: I've no idea what she said.]

1686
01:17:13,640 --> 01:17:16,040
[Hyeyeon: After today,
tomorrow is the final choice.]

1687
01:17:16,040 --> 01:17:18,980
[Hyeyeon: I'm really troubled,
not knowing what to do.]

1688
01:17:19,510 --> 01:17:23,250
[Hyeyeon: Thinking that everything depends on
Seungho's choice,]

1689
01:17:23,250 --> 01:17:26,620
[Hyeyeon: I've decided to switch
to a more proactive mode.]

1690
01:17:26,620 --> 01:17:29,940
[Go Sujin]

1691
01:17:32,940 --> 01:17:34,180
[Knock knock]

1692
01:17:34,180 --> 01:17:35,300
[Knock knock. Come in]

1693
01:17:38,470 --> 01:17:40,870
[Sujin: Why are you here?]

1694
01:17:40,870 --> 01:17:43,540
[Chaebe: Eunchae now]

1695
01:17:44,070 --> 01:17:47,540
[Chaebe: has taken over our sink.]

1696
01:17:49,410 --> 01:17:53,680
[Sujin: Who do you want
to go on today's replay date with?]

1697
01:17:53,680 --> 01:17:55,280
[Chaebe: Do you even have to ask?]

1698
01:17:55,280 --> 01:17:57,950
[Sujin: Yongkyu?]

1699
01:17:58,720 --> 01:18:00,180
Hasn't finished military service.

1700
01:17:59,820 --> 01:18:03,290
[Last night
Message sent to everyone]

1701
01:18:00,820 --> 01:18:01,630
Indeed.

1702
01:18:01,630 --> 01:18:03,030
Why is it buzzing so much?

1703
01:18:03,820 --> 01:18:10,500
[Want to turn back time? Tomorrow is a replay date.
Think about the "day" you want to return to and the "person" to be with]

1704
01:18:10,760 --> 01:18:19,840
[Dates will be finalized tomorrow morning based on your choices.
However, exclude the person you matched with today]

1705
01:18:15,820 --> 01:18:17,410
Did everyone understand the last sentence?

1706
01:18:17,410 --> 01:18:19,080
Exclude the person you matched with today.

1707
01:18:19,080 --> 01:18:19,910
If you match today...

1708
01:18:19,840 --> 01:18:23,840
[Sujin: If we match today,
I can't pick them tomorrow.]

1709
01:18:19,910 --> 01:18:23,210
-You can't pick them tomorrow.
-Can't pick them.

1710
01:18:23,840 --> 01:18:26,250
[Sujin: For example, if Seungho and I
match today,]

1711
01:18:26,250 --> 01:18:30,250
[Sujin: if I say the next day,
"I want to date Seungho"...]

1712
01:18:26,380 --> 01:18:28,200
If I say the next day that I want to
date Seungho...

1713
01:18:28,200 --> 01:18:30,030
Want to date me?

1714
01:18:30,030 --> 01:18:31,490
-That won't work.
-Right.

1715
01:18:30,250 --> 01:18:31,320
[Sujin: That won't work.]

1716
01:18:31,320 --> 01:18:33,020
[Sujin: Because we already matched today.]

1717
01:18:33,060 --> 01:18:34,900
[Understood]

1718
01:18:35,140 --> 01:18:37,190
[Sujin: I guess you want to go back to
when we made pottery?]

1719
01:18:37,190 --> 01:18:38,530
[Sujin: Because you want to do it again.]

1720
01:18:38,530 --> 01:18:41,730
[Jinwoo: Because it broke?
Sujin: Because you want to redo it.]

1721
01:18:41,730 --> 01:18:42,800
[Jinwoo: Not necessarily...]

1722
01:18:42,940 --> 01:18:45,260
[Troubled]

1723
01:18:45,260 --> 01:18:47,870
[Sujin: Chaebe, you want to date me, right?]

1724
01:18:47,870 --> 01:18:50,270
[Chaebe: But we haven't dated.]

1725
01:18:50,270 --> 01:18:53,470
[Seungho: Do you want to replay today's date
with me?]

1726
01:18:52,520 --> 01:18:53,530
But you've dated me.

1727
01:18:53,470 --> 01:18:56,140
[Chaebe: Was I suddenly chosen?]

1728
01:18:56,140 --> 01:18:59,080
[Sujin: I'm the one interested in Chaebe.]

1729
01:18:59,080 --> 01:19:00,410
[Seungho: Haven't you never dated?]

1730
01:19:00,410 --> 01:19:02,280
[Sujin: We will date tomorrow.]

1731
01:19:01,740 --> 01:19:02,440
Oh my god.

1732
01:19:02,550 --> 01:19:04,420
[Sujin: I'm asking for a date.]

1733
01:19:04,420 --> 01:19:06,550
[Chaebe: Really?
Sujin: Yeah.]

1734
01:19:06,550 --> 01:19:10,020
[Hyeyeon: But we already said we would too.
Chaebe: Ah, you startled me.]

1735
01:19:10,720 --> 01:19:11,380
That scared me.

1736
01:19:11,380 --> 01:19:12,690
Wait a minute.

1737
01:19:12,690 --> 01:19:13,550
That scared me.

1738
01:19:13,490 --> 01:19:15,100
[Sujin: Wow, you're so popular, Chaebe.]

1739
01:19:13,550 --> 01:19:16,080
-Wow, Chaebe is so popular.
-That's amazing.

1740
01:19:16,160 --> 01:19:20,170
[Chaebe: But everyone is guessing
about the replay date.]

1741
01:19:20,170 --> 01:19:24,970
[Chaebe: It feels like we need to match
to go on a date.]

1742
01:19:24,970 --> 01:19:27,110
[Sujin: Then we'll be left out again.]

1743
01:19:27,110 --> 01:19:29,240
[Chaebe: You're right.
Sujin: We're going to be guests.]

1744
01:19:29,510 --> 01:19:30,840
[Sujin: What should we do?]

1745
01:19:30,840 --> 01:19:32,980
[Sujin: I'm so unpopular.]

1746
01:19:32,980 --> 01:19:35,120
[Chaebe: Me too.]

1747
01:19:35,120 --> 01:19:37,520
[Sujin: Hmph, I'm going to hate everyone.]

1748
01:19:38,050 --> 01:19:40,450
[Sujin: Just kidding. I like everyone.]

1749
01:19:43,120 --> 01:19:46,590
[Replay date
It's time to choose]

1750
01:19:48,730 --> 01:19:51,670
[If we made different choices back then,
would things be different between us?]

1751
01:19:51,610 --> 01:19:53,260
A pretty person is sitting next to me.

1752
01:19:53,260 --> 01:19:54,240
It feels so new.

1753
01:19:54,240 --> 01:19:55,180
It's been a while.

1754
01:19:54,330 --> 01:20:07,680
[The moments accumulated bit by bit
in BI-LIVE]

1755
01:19:55,180 --> 01:19:55,820
First impression.

1756
01:19:55,820 --> 01:19:56,770
It overlapped.

1757
01:19:58,220 --> 01:19:59,750
-Do you feel like I'm like this?
-Yeah.

1758
01:19:59,750 --> 01:20:00,880
Wait, wait.

1759
01:20:02,250 --> 01:20:03,080
Cheers.

1760
01:20:03,080 --> 01:20:05,480
I'm not just saying it, I really like it.

1761
01:20:05,480 --> 01:20:06,740
We're being very romantic right now.

1762
01:20:06,740 --> 01:20:07,470
Romantic.

1763
01:20:07,470 --> 01:20:09,270
-It feels pretty good.
-Really?

1764
01:20:10,010 --> 01:20:11,370
It's grilled perfectly.

1765
01:20:10,350 --> 01:20:19,160
[If I hadn't said that back then,
if I had been more honest...]

1766
01:20:11,370 --> 01:20:12,200
That's right.

1767
01:20:12,200 --> 01:20:12,930
That's nice.

1768
01:20:12,930 --> 01:20:14,300
My second choice is you.

1769
01:20:14,300 --> 01:20:19,280
10, 9, 8, 7...

1770
01:20:19,280 --> 01:20:20,480
I feel like crying.

1771
01:20:20,230 --> 01:20:25,300
[The moments with slight regrets]

1772
01:20:22,470 --> 01:20:23,780
I'm so sad.

1773
01:20:23,780 --> 01:20:25,510
That's why I'm shedding tears.

1774
01:20:27,430 --> 01:20:30,100
[Maybe things would have changed?]

1775
01:20:31,440 --> 01:20:38,110
[Is there any moment you want to relive?]

1776
01:20:39,300 --> 01:20:46,920
[Write down that moment and the person on a piece of paper
and put it in the Heart Mailbox]

1777
01:20:47,990 --> 01:20:50,390
[Yongkyu: It's not that I want to go back
and do something over again.]

1778
01:20:50,390 --> 01:20:51,990
[Yongkyu: Or make up for some mistakes.]

1779
01:20:52,260 --> 01:20:54,390
[Yongkyu: I came here and acted in my own way.]

1780
01:20:54,390 --> 01:20:56,530
[Yongkyu: Considering what the happy
and joyful moments were,]

1781
01:20:57,060 --> 01:21:01,870
[Yongkyu: I wrote down things that are trivial
but I want to do again.]

1782
01:21:02,670 --> 01:21:09,610
[Chaebe: The memory of walking on the beach
during the first date was beautiful.]

1783
01:21:10,410 --> 01:21:12,810
[Chaebe: Let's just relive the beautiful moments.]

1784
01:21:14,410 --> 01:21:16,020
[Hyeyeon: When we were on a date back then...]

1785
01:21:16,020 --> 01:21:18,950
[Hyeyeon: If the conversation went more smoothly,]

1786
01:21:18,950 --> 01:21:22,690
[Hyeyeon: maybe it's not entirely
impossible for us?]

1787
01:21:24,290 --> 01:21:28,030
[Jinwoo: I want to express my true thoughts
face to face.]

1788
01:21:28,030 --> 01:21:31,500
[Jinwoo: Why exactly I want to go back
to that time...]

1789
01:21:31,500 --> 01:21:34,170
[Jinwoo: I tried to filter it out and wrote it
on the note.]

1790
01:21:35,240 --> 01:21:38,440
[Heejin: Although it's not clear
which moment it is,]

1791
01:21:38,440 --> 01:21:42,710
[Heejin: I think it would be better
if we could talk again in the early days.]

1792
01:21:42,710 --> 01:21:44,580
[Heejin: I wrote it with this thought.]

1793
01:21:44,580 --> 01:21:47,510
[Seungho: I only thought of one scene.]

1794
01:21:47,510 --> 01:21:50,720
[Seungho: I thought of the hurtful things
we said to each other.]

1795
01:21:50,980 --> 01:21:54,450
[Seungho: I want to ask again
if the things said back then were sincere.]

1796
01:21:54,450 --> 01:21:56,060
[Seungho: So I wrote the note.]

1797
01:21:56,860 --> 01:21:58,460
[Eunchae: I want to go back to the past]

1798
01:21:58,460 --> 01:22:01,660
[Eunchae: to talk more actively.]

1799
01:22:02,200 --> 01:22:06,470
[Sujin: I want to clear up the misunderstanding,
if it's not too late.]

1800
01:22:06,470 --> 01:22:09,140
[Sujin: I want to express my true feelings.]

1801
01:22:09,140 --> 01:22:12,070
[Sujin: I wrote these in the note.]

1802
01:22:14,740 --> 01:22:20,350
[Which moment does everyone want to
trace back to?]

1803
01:22:27,550 --> 01:22:35,300
[The notes filled with feelings
that they want to convey to the other person]

1804
01:22:36,900 --> 01:22:40,900
[If time could rewind,
can hearts be won back?]
